# Impeccable working files. Review captures (~20 MB) and the hook cache are
# both regenerable, so they stay out of history.
.impeccable/

# Source images. The originals downloaded from the live site total ~44 MB and
# are kept on disk only; the prototypes ship the optimized WebP set in opt/.
# See ASSETS.md for what each file is and where it came from.
assets/images/*
!assets/images/opt/

# macOS
.DS_Store
